For spells I check the spoilers.  Some have quite a bit of difference
based on skills others no difference.  Cone of cold and fireball go
from a ray to a blast centered on a spot at some skill level for
example.  For the spells that aren't different all that matters is
failure percentage and any way that gets them to 0% is the same
as any other way.  Basic becomes plenty with a robe playing some
classes.

